---
import { coverage } from '../../data/coverage';
---
<section id="cobertura" class="bg-[#f1f3ed] py-20 dark:bg-[#192a21] sm:py-28" aria-labelledby="coverage-title">
  <div class="container-site grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.83fr_1.17fr] lg:gap-16">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Dónde trabajamos</p><h2 id="coverage-title" class="section-title mt-3">Cerca de ti, en el Maule</h2><p class="section-lead">Nuestra base está en Retiro. Atendemos sectores entre Linares y Parral, y evaluamos trabajos en localidades cercanas.</p>
      <ul class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" aria-label="Localidades de atención">
        {coverage.map((place) => <li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#173d2b] shadow-sm dark:bg-[#264231] dark:text-white"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">✓</span>{place}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300">¿No ves tu sector? Escríbenos para confirmar disponibilidad antes de programar una visita.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#d7e4d9] bg-[#dbe8d9] shadow-lg dark:border-white/15">
      <iframe title="Mapa general de Retiro, Región del Maule, Chile" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Retiro%2C%20Maule%2C%20Chile&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" class="h-[350px] w-full border-0 sm:h-[420px]" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-white p-4 text-sm dark:bg-[#254333]"><span class="font-semibold text-stone-700 dark:text-white">Ubicación de referencia: Retiro, Maule</span><a class="font-bold text-emerald-700 underline dark:text-emerald-300" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Retiro%2C+Maule%2C+Chile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abrir mapa ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
